From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anthoine Bourgeois <anthoine.bourgeois@vates.tech>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 16:40:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] qcow2: cancel also a created and not yet running job

Signed-off-by: Anthoine Bourgeois <anthoine.bourgeois@vates.tech>
---
 drivers/block-qcow2.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/block-qcow2.c b/drivers/block-qcow2.c
index 5ea8ddb2..2e6eaeac 100644
--- a/drivers/block-qcow2.c
+++ b/drivers/block-qcow2.c
@@ -477,6 +477,7 @@ qcow2_open(void *opaque)
 		 * everything it references is destroyed below.
 		 */
 		switch (bjob->job.status) {
+		case JOB_STATUS_CREATED:
 		case JOB_STATUS_RUNNING:
 		case JOB_STATUS_PAUSED:
 		case JOB_STATUS_READY:
@@ -1223,6 +1224,7 @@ do_cancel_commit_job(struct qcow2_state *s, struct qcow2_request *req)
 	 * runs on half-initialized or already-cleaned job state.
 	 */
 	switch (bjob->job.status) {
+	case JOB_STATUS_CREATED:
 	case JOB_STATUS_RUNNING:
 	case JOB_STATUS_PAUSED:
 	case JOB_STATUS_READY:
